WEBVTT

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:12.750
Welcome to Japan.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.960
You are Master Li Tenmon, correct?

00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:19.330
They only sent one to meet me?

00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:25.230
Ogata Isshinsai-sensei requested that I meet you here.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.970
This time, on business for YOMI.

00:00:38.470 --> 00:00:39.930
I see!

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:42.300
So this is what the Spark is!

00:00:43.130 --> 00:00:47.100
What amazing fireworks coming from the Protector striking the earth!

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.050
Ryouzanpaku...

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.230
A formidable opponent indeed.

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:00.350
Ken

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:00.350
Su

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:00.350
i

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:00.350
b

00:00:57.430 --> 00:01:00.350
ch

00:00:57.430 --> 00:01:00.350
DE

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.350
i

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:00.350
SU

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:07.830
Kenichi

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:07.830
SubDESU

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:07.830
History's Strongest Disciple

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:07.830
Presents

00:01:08.180 --> 00:01:12.280
The Girl Who Arrived From China

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:12.820
Shinpaku Rengou

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:13.520
Ken’ichi!

00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:16.280
Ah, Niijima.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:18.470
How many times must I tell you before you’ll understand?

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:22.420
Flowers are NOT the right look for our secret hideout.

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:24.790
It’s more like the "secret garden", I suppose.

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:27.110
Bah, this stripe stands for a high class position!

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:31.420
If you do that, then I’m leaving this group. Pronto.

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:33.420
Ken’ichi...

00:01:33.420 --> 00:01:36.540
Please, have more pride in your status as Number 2.

00:01:36.700 --> 00:01:39.400
It may feel like it’s just a game to you right now,

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:44.150
but in the future, I hope that this is a martial arts organization with you at the center!

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:47.970
Well then! What shall I plant in this pot?

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:51.000
Hey! Are you listening to me?

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:53.000
No, I’m not.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:55.290
Construction entrance

00:01:56.790 --> 00:01:59.740
Oh, what should I do?

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.840
What a nice coincidence!

00:02:08.190 --> 00:02:09.500
Do you know where this house is?

00:02:10.380 --> 00:02:13.380
Huh? This map is all wrong.

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:15.590
Your destination point doesn’t make any sense.

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.150
True that, true that...

00:02:18.030 --> 00:02:18.870
Flowers!

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:20.990
They sure are pretty.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:22.990
Aren’t they?

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.580
With nothing but concrete and asphalt around, it’s hard to relax.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.790
True that, true that!

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:31.350
I came here from a rural town in China.

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:34.110
And the thing I hate the most about Japan so far...

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:35.990
Is that there’s no open spaces anywhere!

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:38.160
You’re Chinese?

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:42.700
And you’re right! They can’t just cover all our good land in buildings!

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.750
Lemme see.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.670
Japanese soil sure is nice!

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:51.700
See? A worm!

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:55.120
You’re right... Worms are a good sign of nutrients in the soil.

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.120
Proof that the soil here is very fertile.

00:02:58.020 --> 00:03:03.960
The farm I grew up on in China... has very poor soil. It’s difficult to grow anything.

00:03:06.800 --> 00:03:13.670
I want to work hard in Japan, move up the ranks, and help my family back home in China.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.370
You’re so admirable.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:19.050
I’m ashamed for thinking so selfishly all the time.

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:21.280
What a relief!

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:24.270
You’re the first Japanese person who’s really understood me.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:25.380
Me too.

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:28.650
I had a lot of fun talking with someone who understands gardening.

00:03:29.160 --> 00:03:33.780
And you know... this map, no matter which way you look at it, your destination point is...

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:34.500
Shinpaku Rengou {tlc: this and the next sign was missing}

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:36.680
Shinpaku Rengou {tlc: this and the next sign was missing}

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.340
This place, right?

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:39.680
Shinpaku Rengou

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:42.230
Yep. Then it's okay.

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.220
Today was just a dry run anyway.

00:03:44.610 --> 00:03:45.240
See ya.

00:03:45.610 --> 00:03:47.590
See you tomorrow, Mr. Florist.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:51.240
What a weird girl.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:58.330
I think on this land you might be able to plant some sweet potato-sans.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:00.330
Or maybe banana-sans.

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:05.130
I don’t think Japan is tropical enough to grow bananas.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:09.890
Did you know that watermelon-sans aren’t fruit?

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:14.680
Oops.

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:19.860
From Li Tenmon or the Chishou Clan...

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:22.110
It appears as though he has joined with Yami.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:29.530
For many moons and years Yami has been growing... in the back of the underworld.

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:33.770
And now... it is trying to crawl out to the surface.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.100
Their target is clear as day.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:39.740
The strongest disciple in history.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:48.400
Ken’ichi! Are you okay?

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:52.770
And what’s more, they are fully aware of the existence of the apprentice.

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:51.510
<i>Oh, hi, Renka-san. I didn’t know you were here.</i>

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:57.930
Because it is legendary... passed down from generation to generation...

00:04:58.220 --> 00:05:00.790
The apprentice is indispensable.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:04.970
In other words... their main target is...

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.860
My, how adorable.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.660
To put it simply - Shirahama Ken’ichi.

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.320
Whoa, easy there!

00:05:09.350 --> 00:05:10.350
That's true.

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:11.870
What the hell!

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.200
However, they don’t act directly, do they?

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:15.720
Can’t you see he doesn’t like it?

00:05:14.560 --> 00:05:16.260
By the hand of their own apprentice,

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:19.210
destroying the apprentice at Ryouzanpaku...

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:23.030
It's the ideal scenario for Yami.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:28.860
In other words...

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:31.220
He who possesses the strongest apprentice...

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:34.240
...Will win this duel!

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:38.700
Hot! Hot! Hot! Hot!

00:05:36.990 --> 00:05:38.580
Sorry, sorry.{Nyan, nyan, nyan, nyan.}

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:41.420
Nyan! Just don’t do it again!

00:05:41.550 --> 00:05:43.630
Hey, Ken’ichi.

00:05:44.490 --> 00:05:46.910
Don’t lie around the place.

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:48.520
Come with me.

00:05:48.670 --> 00:05:50.610
To an oasis of the heart.

00:05:50.770 --> 00:05:52.250
Oasis!

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.390
Yes.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:55.830
Our secret hideout filled with flowers.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:05:59.040
Stop it, stop it!

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:02.010
But before that...

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:05.790
Those two behind me... dispose of them, will you?

00:06:05.930 --> 00:06:07.630
We have an intruder-san.

00:06:10.520 --> 00:06:11.440
Pardon me.

00:06:11.700 --> 00:06:13.180
Carry on, everyone.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:15.470
Hello, it is I.

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:17.880
Wh-What?

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:21.930
Get back!

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:26.020
You bitch - I’m <i>asking</i> who the hell you are!

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:30.630
Well I guess it really doesn’t matter who you are.

00:06:30.830 --> 00:06:32.570
You’re not gonna live much longer anyway.

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.660
Kisara-sama, keep calm!

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:37.360
That’s some high class psychology!

00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.030
Are ya sure?

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:41.840
Well, now you’re wobbling.

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:47.220
That is <i>not</i> wobbling. That move is...

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.290
Ah! I also know that technique!

00:06:52.640 --> 00:06:53.810
Drunken Fist...

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:55.990
Why you...!

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:07.370
Kisara!

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:08.390
Kisara-sama!

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:12.340
As I thought... you are no mere street tough!

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:17.130
I have no quarrel with you. My target is...

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:19.300
Shirahama Ken’ichi’s gang!

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:20.520
Now I see.

00:07:21.180 --> 00:07:26.560
You are a Protector, who unleashes blood in this concrete jungle

00:07:28.110 --> 00:07:32.860
You'd never use a bolt-gun as a weapon - you are too proud.

00:07:33.490 --> 00:07:35.210
I am deeply impressed.

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:38.240
What nice eyes you’ve got.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:41.290
Are <i>you</i> Shirahama Ken’ichi?

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:45.070
This person... she doesn’t know what Captain Shirahama looks like!

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.690
In that case, we’ll let her keep the misunderstanding...

00:07:47.800 --> 00:07:49.370
The answer to your question...

00:07:49.430 --> 00:07:53.010
Shall be answered by me, the great Siegfried!

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:54.890
Damn, he said it!

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:02.480
Awesome!

00:08:02.650 --> 00:08:04.330
That’s our Captain Sieg!

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:06.960
The sparks are in my eyes...

00:08:08.210 --> 00:08:09.010
Sieg!

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:11.550
Bring me Shirahama Ken’ichi.

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:14.130
Unless you want this "Sieg" fellow to die.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:15.390
Make it quick.

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:18.590
P-Please kill me.

00:08:18.750 --> 00:08:20.690
If it’s Ken’ichi you’re looking for, he’s right here.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:22.080
It’s me.

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:23.780
I’m Ken’ichi-kun.

00:08:23.970 --> 00:08:25.400
Unhand Sieg at once!

00:08:25.540 --> 00:08:28.530
With the "kun" suffix, he’s already given himself away!

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:33.380
I’m the real Shirahama Ken’ichi.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:38.080
That’s enough.

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.620
Unhand Sieg-san.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.890
That is my first act... as officer of the Shinpaku Rengo...

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:46.430
I am Niijima Haruo-sama!

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:50.620
Captain Sieg!

00:08:56.990 --> 00:09:01.200
Muay Thai, Jujitsu, Karate, Kung Fu...

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:04.600
Now I see. I can see your skills without you moving.

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:06.170
You appear to be the real thing.

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:10.890
And I, Spark of the YOMI, will claim your life!

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:15.060
Ryouzanpaku... Shirahama Ken’ichi.

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:16.420
Fight!

00:09:18.570 --> 00:09:21.450
What is... Ken’ichi thinking?

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:23.620
Is he really gonna hit a girl?

00:09:24.480 --> 00:09:27.390
Taking down an opponent in a fight to the death...

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:32.240
Without drawing any blood... is something most people can’t accomplish.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:46.450
Hey, you bastard!

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.050
What do you think you’re doing?

00:09:48.050 --> 00:09:52.490
You just come at me with all those flimsy fists and feet - why don’t you try a more deadly attack on me?

00:09:53.390 --> 00:09:55.030
She’s onto him!

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.420
This’s not good...

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:01.760
The truth is... I decided to never hit a lady.

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:03.020
What?

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:08.860
Then die with your chivalry! Your gang needs no heir.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.110
Oh, but they do!

00:10:11.520 --> 00:10:13.830
Now it’s onto my last resort.

00:10:16.630 --> 00:10:17.300
What?

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:19.010
He... He’s flying?

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:22.050
That pose... it’s Ma-san's legendary attack!

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:25.410
And what’s more, he’s moving like Daddy does when he’s horny!

00:10:28.700 --> 00:10:30.750
How low can one get?

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.220
He’s desperate.

00:10:32.460 --> 00:10:35.490
I don’t recognize these moves... I can’t read what’s coming next...

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:39.460
It’s because there <i>is</i> no next move. He’s just trying to cop a feel.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:41.460
Stop it, Ken’ichi-san!

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:43.040
You’re a disgrace to the honor of martial arts!

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:46.170
All right! Keep at it, Ken’ichi!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:48.650
I got it!

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:50.340
Damn it!

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:54.420
Go straight in. Revise your plan as needed, and win.

00:10:55.520 --> 00:10:58.260
That is one technique of the Master of Ryouzanpaku.

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:01.840
Your joint is dislocated.

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:03.400
Surrender at once.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:04.950
Oh, I really don’t think so.

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:08.210
The job of a florist suits you better, I think.

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:09.080
What?

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:18.800
You are almost like a flower yourself - you grew up under the bright sun.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:20.520
But...

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:24.040
Wherever there is brightness, there is darkness.

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:26.940
Hey, I know you...?!

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:29.770
You cannot defeat me.

00:11:29.990 --> 00:11:33.210
And that is because your attitude towards fighting is different from mine.

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:36.660
You’re that weird hick-girl from China!

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:38.660
Who are you?

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:41.510
My name is Li Raichi.

00:11:42.060 --> 00:11:45.170
Of the Chishou Clan... Li Tenmon’s daughter.

00:11:45.340 --> 00:11:48.980
And... I’m a soldier in the Yami guard.

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:50.620
One of the YOMI.

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:52.020
Yami?

00:11:52.660 --> 00:11:55.050
My training with YOMI all these years was all...

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.900
For the sake of my family back in China.

00:11:59.680 --> 00:12:02.280
If I defeat the top apprentice at Ryouzanpaku,

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.340
I will be promoted to top official in Yami.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.700
From VIPs to military higher-ups,

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:09.210
I can assassinate whomever I wish.

00:12:09.440 --> 00:12:11.970
Any assignment I accomplish will give me enough money to swim in.

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:16.720
Now you’re talking a bit crazy there.

00:12:17.070 --> 00:12:19.580
Is this girl right in the head?

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:22.670
You can’t kill someone as a joke.

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:26.790
So, are you saying you’re gonna kill Ken’ichi-kun for the money?

00:12:27.220 --> 00:12:29.080
What a psycho twin tail! {tl had it "What a psycho bitch"}{tlc: he's using "twin tail" ..maybe referring from her hair to her split personality". I wouldn't just use psycho bitch there}

00:12:29.470 --> 00:12:32.450
You all do martial arts for sport - what would you understand?!

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:35.850
To my clan, martial arts is a way of life.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:38.840
This ends our little chat.

00:12:39.290 --> 00:12:41.950
I wanted to tell you that before I killed you.

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:45.730
Now you die!

00:12:46.670 --> 00:12:47.840
Masaya!

00:12:48.720 --> 00:12:49.510
Damn it!

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:53.200
Ken’ichi-san!

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:55.760
What?

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:58.480
He’s suddenly gotten worse...

00:13:02.300 --> 00:13:09.220
I see. Usually Ken’ichi, who's pretty small, takes on much larger opponents.

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:13.700
So blocking attacks coming at him from a lower level must be difficult for him.

00:13:18.240 --> 00:13:19.430
Chokaro!

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:27.590
Die!

00:13:31.040 --> 00:13:31.640
Oh no!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:37.330
You’re right, I don’t earn any money with my martial arts.

00:13:38.070 --> 00:13:41.790
But that doesn’t mean that I’m doing it just as a little hobby.

00:13:42.830 --> 00:13:46.360
I’m doing martial arts for my own soul!

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:52.820
And to be able to stand up to any bully who picks on the innocent!

00:13:53.630 --> 00:13:55.820
And so that I can protect those I love!

00:13:56.610 --> 00:13:58.310
<i>That</i> is why I do martial arts!

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:05.860
To act for your family is a noble thing... but if you’re doing martial arts to kill and make money,

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:10.990
then I wouldn’t be able to respect myself... if I let you defeat me!

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:17.840
If you want to use your martial arts to hurt my friends and to kill me,

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:19.860
then I have to stop you.

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.040
I have to save you from yourself!

00:14:23.910 --> 00:14:26.740
He has to save her from herself... huh.

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:32.400
I think most of his strength comes from that - his straightforward kindness towards everyone.

00:14:32.740 --> 00:14:33.410
Yes, indeed.

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.170
What a nice idea.

00:14:36.660 --> 00:14:37.690
But how will you carry it out?

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:44.050
From the looks of things, it’s as if you don’t even know how to deal with low attacks.

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.580
H-He sat down!

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:58.550
In Drunken Fist, that makes attacking all the easier.

00:14:59.450 --> 00:15:03.000
Or does that posture mean you’ve given up trying to fight back?

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:07.900
Hey, Ken’ichi! Stop taking a break and get serious here!

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:10.660
I see! That’s a smart move!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:15.370
I don’t see an opening... he’s not <i>just</i> sitting...

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:20.810
It’s the one way to emerge from a fight with the Chishou clan’s daughter without any wounds.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.170
What are you talking about?

00:15:23.720 --> 00:15:25.970
That’s a fighter's stance indeed.

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:31.750
What?!

00:15:32.070 --> 00:15:34.000
He parried my attack while sitting?!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.700
That was the idori kneeling defense!

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:41.060
What was that just now?

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:47.210
Japan is the one country who uses the seiza sitting position to spring from for a last-minute counter-attack.

00:15:47.940 --> 00:15:54.020
That is why they sit in seiza when their lives are in danger - it is a special move for a special circumstance.

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:58.850
When sitting in that vulnerable position,

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:03.140
wven if you are attacked - by a weapon, at that -

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:07.490
you can parry any attack with this special stance.

00:16:08.420 --> 00:16:10.580
It’s a very harsh counter-attack.

00:16:13.440 --> 00:16:17.980
So if he takes a vulnerable stance, he can counter her attacks without killing her.

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:21.200
Japanese people really are too honorable.

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:25.580
But I think that move suits Ken’ichi-san perfectly.

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:31.040
Though I’m impressed he’s taking it that far...

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:33.380
The fight is totally his!

00:16:33.420 --> 00:16:35.340
He did it! He’s awesome!

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:38.100
This time, don’t move. And surrender!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.160
Hey! Can’t you hear me?

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:43.720
Let’s end this.

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:44.800
Stop moving!

00:16:45.860 --> 00:16:47.290
You’ll break your bones!

00:16:49.710 --> 00:16:50.240
They’ll break...

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:53.060
No way!

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:54.310
He slipped!

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:56.750
He let her go on purpose.

00:16:56.930 --> 00:16:57.940
Ken’ichi-san.

00:16:58.430 --> 00:16:59.930
You’re pitying me?

00:17:00.390 --> 00:17:02.560
In YOMI we call that "foolishness"!

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:07.670
Shimoke-tori!

00:17:09.580 --> 00:17:10.780
I’m sorry, flowers!

00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:17.220
You’re just an idiot who grows flowers on the roof...

00:17:21.330 --> 00:17:22.930
Wow... she’s furious...

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:27.830
I don’t blame her. Our martial arts partly is for sport.

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:30.080
But he won’t let her escape.

00:17:31.220 --> 00:17:33.070
I can’t let you defeat me!

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:35.230
I can’t lose!

00:17:40.920 --> 00:17:43.100
That idiot - he let her go again.

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.240
Stop fucking with me!

00:17:48.480 --> 00:17:49.690
I can’t hold back anymore...

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:52.070
Shinpaku Rengou Fire!

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:54.640
<i>Stay back!</i>

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.910
Flag: Shinpaku Rengou

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:02.330
Why?

00:18:05.190 --> 00:18:06.290
Why are you doing this?!

00:18:08.530 --> 00:18:11.240
Why can’t... I kill you?

00:18:15.710 --> 00:18:16.750
Of course you can’t.

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:26.380
To someone who loves the earth... and flowers... murder is impossible from the start.

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:41.810
Ah, I let you go twice.

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:43.490
But it can’t be helped.

00:18:44.310 --> 00:18:46.450
I have a pride as a martial arts master, too.

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:48.280
You win this fight.

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:54.680
Let’s just stop this.

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:58.810
That’s it! Let’s talk with the leaders at Ryouzanpaku.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:02.180
I’m sure they’ll have some good ideas for you.

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:04.490
Well, I...

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:05.750
That’s enough!

00:19:06.510 --> 00:19:08.210
Face punishment from the clan!

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:12.880
Raichi-san!

00:19:14.150 --> 00:19:15.050
What are you doing?

00:19:15.960 --> 00:19:19.840
I think I’ll take you back as a souvenir.

00:19:20.210 --> 00:19:21.620
Who the hell are you?

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:24.920
I am of the Chishou clan. Li Tenmon.

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:27.280
I am her father.

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:29.930
Number one apprentice of Ryouzanpaku,

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:32.390
we will take you to Yami with us.

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:35.110
Niijima Eyes!

00:19:35.250 --> 00:19:36.390
Let me explain!

00:19:36.570 --> 00:19:43.060
We at Niijima Soutoku use alien powers to see through an opponent’s fighting abilities and weaknesses!

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.720
Smell

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.720
Body Strength

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.720
Size

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.720
Power

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.720
Fashion sense

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:43.720
Speed

00:19:43.650 --> 00:19:44.640
Signs: DANGER

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:51.460
Re...Retreat! Retreat!

00:19:52.090 --> 00:19:53.590
You must run now!

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:56.690
That man is... That man is...!

00:19:57.050 --> 00:19:58.940
Oh shit!

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:06.850
You will surrender.

00:20:07.530 --> 00:20:09.200
Don’t distract me!

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:21.820
What? Missiles?!

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:24.740
No...

00:20:25.890 --> 00:20:27.560
It’s Chishou-method fighting!

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:36.220
For many years, the Chishou has refined its fighting technique

00:20:36.770 --> 00:20:40.940
through the soil and connection to the elements.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:45.010
But that is not all!

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:46.400
Our blood is proud.

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:48.710
And we have the power to become our own sword!

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:50.630
That is the Chishou-method!

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:56.680
Blood is an unbreakable shield...

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:58.790
...a fist that can't be dodged or parried.

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:00.480
Watch out, Ken’ichi!

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:06.670
Yes! Blood is power!

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.730
All units! Retreat into the base at once!

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:10.920
Hurry!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:14.120
Get in! We’ll lock them out!

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:16.410
W-Wait! Sieg-san is still out there!

00:21:16.030 --> 00:21:17.770
<i>Screw that guy!</i>

00:21:18.300 --> 00:21:19.760
Forgive me, Sieg!

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:22.310
Gotta make it stronger than that!

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:28.030
That was a clever idea.

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:30.680
You’re pretty smart, little fellow.

00:21:31.020 --> 00:21:33.580
You have talent for war.

00:21:39.270 --> 00:21:40.510
So this is it?!

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:45.080
I won’t let you!

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:50.540
I wouldn’t expect less from the proud Li Tenmon of the Chishou clan.

00:21:50.770 --> 00:21:51.730
Who the hell are you?

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:54.740
I won’t let you get a hit in.

00:21:55.890 --> 00:21:58.730
Ma Kensei, Chinese Kenpo Master!

00:21:59.130 --> 00:22:00.020
Sifu!

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:00.950
Daddy!

00:22:01.400 --> 00:22:04.720
Hey, your beloved daughter was hurt in this fight!

00:22:05.370 --> 00:22:09.050
Argh! Anyway, all you need to know is he’s a really bad man!

00:22:09.140 --> 00:22:10.940
Go punish him!

00:22:11.040 --> 00:22:13.850
Yes, daughter, leave this to Daddy.

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:16.130
Then let’s go!

00:22:16.410 --> 00:22:19.480
Chishou Renkan Shouken Kyappou!

00:22:25.160 --> 00:22:27.090
It’s gonna break!

00:22:30.260 --> 00:22:31.790
He’s gonna break through...!

00:22:31.980 --> 00:22:32.830
Daddy!

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:37.240
No! He’s parrying all the attacks!

00:22:45.500 --> 00:22:46.520
Oops, I goof’ed.

00:22:46.940 --> 00:22:47.740
Daddy!

00:22:50.240 --> 00:22:51.940
Foolish Ma Kensei!

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:57.230
My Chishou clan has been trained long and hard throughout the generations.

00:22:57.500 --> 00:22:59.950
Your arm is <i>mine</i>!

00:23:00.210 --> 00:23:01.090
Sifu!

00:23:07.340 --> 00:23:08.720
Sendan Oke! {?} {tlc: Senda Oke!  isn't that just the name of this move? Senda is some sort of kung fu...and oke would be some term for a punch.}

00:23:09.080 --> 00:23:10.070
Awesome!

00:23:10.400 --> 00:23:12.170
He did it!

00:23:14.000 --> 00:23:17.380
We have small bodies.

00:23:17.940 --> 00:23:20.300
So whenever a larger man traps us,

00:23:20.570 --> 00:23:23.330
toriake sunkei isn’t good.

00:23:26.720 --> 00:23:27.370
Wait!

00:23:27.960 --> 00:23:31.480
Sifu... please don’t kill my dad!

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:34.420
Stop it! You fool!

00:23:34.620 --> 00:23:35.350
But I...!

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:40.510
In any case... this man doesn’t have killing in his blood.

00:23:43.470 --> 00:23:46.420
You pulled back, didn’t you, Kensei?

00:23:49.680 --> 00:23:55.620
Your last attack... you clearly took out the force behind it at the last minute.

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:58.400
And what about you?

00:23:58.710 --> 00:24:00.640
I think you were holding back too.

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:02.230
What?

00:24:02.630 --> 00:24:06.200
If you need proof, my daughter is still alive.

00:24:08.030 --> 00:24:08.560
Right?

00:24:09.090 --> 00:24:11.110
If you really had been serious,

00:24:11.270 --> 00:24:15.670
this entire building would be plastered in blood and shards of flesh.

00:24:17.990 --> 00:24:19.880
Because you are also a loving father.

00:24:20.360 --> 00:24:25.760
Miu and Renka reminded you of your daughter and you couldn’t bring yourself to let them die.

00:24:31.430 --> 00:24:32.780
We’ll call a temporary truce...

00:24:33.270 --> 00:24:35.150
But we will settle the score later.

00:24:35.330 --> 00:24:36.530
Ma Kensei.

00:24:37.280 --> 00:24:41.000
That arrangement helps me out in many ways.

00:24:41.630 --> 00:24:45.710
Slash open the path... with the sword that guides others to their destinations.

00:24:46.050 --> 00:24:47.550
Katsujinken, eh?

00:24:48.740 --> 00:24:50.800
You are Shirahama Ken’ichi, right?

00:24:51.420 --> 00:24:53.420
Top apprentice at Ryouzanpaku.

00:24:54.960 --> 00:25:02.690
From this point forward, I anticipate many fighters challenging you.

00:25:03.590 --> 00:25:04.330
However...

00:25:05.640 --> 00:25:10.740
Will your Katsujinken work on all of them?

00:25:48.480 --> 00:25:54.870
Mado o tsutau ame sora wa tozasarete

00:25:48.480 --> 00:25:54.870
Rain falls down the windows from the closed sky.

00:25:48.480 --> 00:25:54.870
窓を伝う雨 空は閉ざされて

00:25:55.540 --> 00:26:02.040
Fui ni kodoku ni tsukamaru hi mo aru

00:25:55.540 --> 00:26:02.040
There are days when loneliness suddenly catches me.

00:25:55.540 --> 00:26:02.040
ふいに孤独に 捕まる日もある

00:26:03.050 --> 00:26:09.660
Kiyou demo nai shi chikamichi de wa nai

00:26:03.050 --> 00:26:09.660
I’m not very skilled, and I’m not on the easiest path.

00:26:03.050 --> 00:26:09.660
器用でもないし、近道ではない

00:26:10.080 --> 00:26:16.510
Dakara koso deaeta hito ga ita yo

00:26:10.080 --> 00:26:16.510
But that’s why I’m especially happy that I met you.

00:26:10.080 --> 00:26:16.510
だからこそ出逢えた人がいたよ

00:26:17.380 --> 00:26:23.950
Itsumo massugu na hitomi de itai yo

00:26:17.380 --> 00:26:23.950
I want your honest eyes to penetrate me always

00:26:17.380 --> 00:26:23.950
いつも真っ直ぐな瞳でいたいよ

00:26:24.830 --> 00:26:31.120
Negai hitotsubu, nagareteku

00:26:24.830 --> 00:26:31.120
My one wish shoots into the sky.

00:26:24.830 --> 00:26:31.120
願いひとつぶ、流れてく

00:26:31.720 --> 00:26:35.110
Staring eyes miteite ne

00:26:31.720 --> 00:26:35.110
Staring eyes, keep looking at me.

00:26:31.720 --> 00:26:35.110
Staring eyes 見ていてね

00:26:35.290 --> 00:26:38.770
Kitto kanaete miseru

00:26:35.290 --> 00:26:38.770
And I will make your wishes come true.

00:26:35.290 --> 00:26:38.770
きっと叶えてみせる

00:26:38.960 --> 00:26:43.240
Kasanaru koe to kodou, kanjite iru yo

00:26:38.960 --> 00:26:43.240
I feel our voices and heartbeats match up

00:26:38.960 --> 00:26:43.240
重なる声と鼓動、感じているよ

00:26:43.430 --> 00:26:46.400
Nakitaku naru toki mo

00:26:43.430 --> 00:26:46.400
Even in times when I want to cry.

00:26:43.430 --> 00:26:46.400
泣きたくなる時も

00:26:46.470 --> 00:26:49.670
I just feel, “Thank you for you”

00:26:46.470 --> 00:26:49.670
I just feel, “Thank you for you”

00:26:46.470 --> 00:26:49.670
I just feel, “Thank you for you”

00:26:49.860 --> 00:26:53.250
Chiisa na boku no senaka ni

00:26:49.860 --> 00:26:53.250
Against my small back,

00:26:49.860 --> 00:26:53.250
小さな僕の背中に

00:26:53.500 --> 00:26:57.610
Kimi ga kureta yuuki, hane ni natte ku

00:26:53.500 --> 00:26:57.610
The courage you gave me turns to wings.

00:26:53.500 --> 00:26:57.610
君がくれた勇気、羽になってく

00:26:57.620 --> 00:27:00.090
“Hitori ja nai”

00:26:57.620 --> 00:27:00.090
“You’re not alone”

00:26:57.620 --> 00:27:00.090
「独りじゃない」

00:27:00.510 --> 00:27:05.010
My glory days

00:27:00.510 --> 00:27:05.010
My glory days.

00:27:00.510 --> 00:27:05.010
My glory days
